Action: evaluate_strategy
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w11","pool":"pool3","rationale":"shrinkage 0.5 on pool3"}

Thought: The ranking is unstable and many models are correlated; a robust mean over the most stable 7 models may beat the current leader.  
Action: select_stable  
Action Input: {"k":7}

